{"id":"slava","lemma":"слава","pos":"noun","rank":553,"glosses":["glory","fame, renown","repute, reputation"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/16/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"славы","plural":"славы"},"examples":[{"text":"Слава богу, никто не умер.","en":"Thank God nobody died.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283156","words":[null,{"g":"God","l":"бог"},{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"}]},{"text":"Слава богу, ты меня нашла.","en":"Thank God you found me.","words":[null,{"g":"God","l":"бог"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"to find","l":"найти"}]},{"text":"Слава богу, все были в порядке.","en":"Thank God everyone was OK.","words":[null,{"g":"God","l":"бог"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},{"g":"were","l":"быть"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"in order"]]},{"text":"Слава богу, вы живы.","en":"Thank God you're alive.","words":[null,{"g":"God","l":"бог"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null]},{"text":"Слава богу, всё закончилось.","en":"Thank goodness that's over.","words":[null,{"g":"God","l":"бог"},{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to finish","l":"закончиться"}]}]}